==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|govoriti|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|gow(H)-|to call, cry|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-говорить.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|[gəvʌ'rʲitʲ]}}

===Verb===
'''говорить''' (govorít’) {{impf}}, [[сказать]] (skazát’) {{pf}}

# to [[speak]], to [[talk]]
# to [[say]], to [[tell]]

